        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Premium Collection are delighted to offer this wonderfully presented 3 Bedroom semi-detached family home located in the much sought after and recently built Glenheron development.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet cul-de-sac this premium A rated energy efficient home is convenient to every amenity being only a short distance from the picturesque town of Greystones.\r\n\r\nExuding warmth and cosiness the downstairs is light and bright with a central wood-panelled hallway accessing a spacious Livingroom to the front with a large picture window and laminated wood flooring. The open plan kitchen/family room and dining area, the heart of the home, is bright and spacious. It offers a kitchen island with ample counter space and polished stone countertops, contemporary and sleek kitchen cabinets, a good range of integrated appliances and there is also an adjacent utility room with plenty of storage. Completing the downstairs area includes a good sized bathroom and an additional storage closet.\r\n\r\nUpstairs comprises three good sized bedrooms and a main bathroom with separate bath and shower and floor to ceiling tile. The spacious master bedroom includes fitted wardrobes and an en-suite shower room with floor to ceiling tile. There is also scope for attic conversion which could add living space if needed.\r\n\r\nThe brick-paved front driveway comprises two private parking spaces and the sizable and secure low-maintenance rear garden can be accessed either from the side of the house or through two large glass patio doors from the kitchen/family room. The garden also includes a large stone patio area, ideal for entertaining and barbecues, and a good-sized garden shed.\r\n\r\nGlenheron Park is a modern, family-focused development just 2.6km from Greystones town centre and the DART station. The estate features expansive green areas and children's play zones, while a wide range of sports and leisure amenities are located just around the corner. These include a 400m running track, skate park, five-a-side football pitches, and a fully equipped gym. Safe cycling and walking paths link the development directly to Greystones, where you'll find even more amenities such as a swimming pool, tennis courts, rugby and GAA clubs, and a golf course.\r\n\r\nConvenience is key, with local transport links including Dublin Bus routes just a short walk away. Everyday essentials are easily accessible with a SuperValu shopping centre only 500m from the doorstep. For families, the area is particularly appealing with several highly regarded schools nearby, Greystones Community National School is just 100m away, and the new Greystones Community College is set to open only 300m from the property. Commuters will also appreciate the proximity to main road networks via the nearby Farrankelly Road, with seamless access to the N11, M11, and M50.\r\n\r\nImpeccably presented with an excellent specification throughout, this wonderfully maintained home must be seen to be truly appreciated.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
